Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>A tick and a tock goes my heart beatin'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Please say yes, please say yes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>I'm bracin'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>For the day you bend on your knees and confess to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b> Say it one more time, say it one more time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>愛して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Sorry but I can't say it first, cuz this-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Do you wanna stay a virgin forever?<c=#e27d9b> (NUH, UH!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>or come right into me?~<c=#e27d9b> (HUHH?)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Yeah this choice ain't, ain't no epiphany!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Yeah this love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Did you think that it was more?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>If you're gonna raise the bet, baby I'll play hard to get!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>When what's said is said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>I'll be leavin' you on read
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Bet you're rotting on your bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>See there ain't no use in playin' dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>What a blunder, blunder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>You fell for my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Don't gimme that sentimental crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Ain't no use in playin' dead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>IQ higher, higher
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>I'm on top of the grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Need I remind you that you're nothing but a spade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>If this love was war, I'm winnin'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Act so tough, but heart still spinnin'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Say you hate me, but you cappin'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>In the end, you're still just lackin'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>You got talk, but ain't no walk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Actin' so loud, but you soft, like chalk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>If you wanna confess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>That might be best
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you tryna impress?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>At the end of the day, I just feel so lost
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,(love or hate, it's all the same)
