Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Yeah this love is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Did I have you wantin' more?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>If you're gonna get obsessed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>then I might just want you less!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>When what's said is said
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>I'll be leavin' you on read
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>It's that thrill of playin' guess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#83e7e7>Yeah there ain't no way that I confess!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,<c=#e27d9b>Oh I wonder, wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,, <c=#e27d9b>What will make you snap?
